<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    font-family: "Noto Sans SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
    background: #f2f2f0;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 20px;
  }
  .page {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 14px;
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .column {
    background: #fff;
    width: 33.3%;
    padding: 10px 12px 16px 12px;
    border: 1px solid #ccc;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .placeholder {
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(
      45deg, #e8e8e8, #e8e8e8 10px, #f5f5f5 10px, #f5f5f5 20px
    );
    border: 1px dashed #999;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: #555;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  /* Column 1: 2x2 photo grid */
  .photo-grid {
    width: 100%;
    height: 200px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    grid-template-rows: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 2px;
  }
  .photo-grid .placeholder {
    height: 100%;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  /* Column 2: illustration */
  .illustration-box {
    width: 100%;
    height: 200px;
  }

  /* Column 3: single colorful photo */
  .photo-box {
    width: 100%;
    height: 200px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2f7d4f 0%, #d69a3e 40%, #b23c3c 70%, #1e3a5f 100%);
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-shadow: 0 0 3px #000;
  }

  .author-name {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: bold;
    letter-spacing: 6px;
    margin: 4px 0 10px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #333;
    padding-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .body-text {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    line-height: 1.9;
    text-align: justify;
    color: #222;
  }

  .body-text p {
    margin: 0 0 10px 0;
    text-indent: 1em;
  }

  .illegible {
    color: #b00;
    font-style: italic;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">

  <!-- Column 1 -->
  <div class="column">
    <div class="photo-grid">
      <div class="placeholder">[Photo: portrait, close-up 1]</div>
      <div class="placeholder">[Photo: portrait, close-up 2]</div>
      <div class="placeholder">[Photo: person holding object]</div>
      <div class="placeholder">[Photo: person holding paper/photo]</div>
    </div>
    <div class="author-name">井上雄彦</div>
    <div class="body-text">
      <p>最近，我突然想养只狗。</p>
      <p>小时候，我非常喜欢猫、狗之类的动物，记得自己曾经给街坊的狗随便取名叫"长洛"，跟它一起玩。</p>
      <p>我现在住的坊也养着一只大狗，名字叫"银次"。当我从隔着老不多跟我一般高的院墙叫"银次"的时候，它便会伸出大大的脑袋，并把两只大大的前爪搭在院墙上，一直盯着我。</p>
      <p>我当时想，如果自己养一只大狗该多好。</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Column 2 -->
  <div class="column">
    <div class="illustration-box placeholder">[Illustration: red sketch of person wearing cap, filmstrip border]</div>
    <div class="author-name">井上雄彦</div>
    <div class="body-text">
      <p>刚开始画"灌篮高手"时的愿望，如今已经实现了两个。</p>
      <p>一是以采访为名前往美国观看NBA的决赛。</p>
      <p>另一个是以采访为名前往巴西罗那现场观看这以会。真要感谢上帝。</p>
      <p>不下几把是希望能看到日本篮球队获得来自世界的线球。那些少年读者曾经在来信中写到，自从我看了《灌篮高手》后自然开始打篮球了。那时达到我的读者们大之后如果实现我的梦想的话，我一定会激动地放声大哭。</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Column 3 -->
  <div class="column">
    <div class="photo-box placeholder">[Photo: colorful painted portrait, "KODAK 5028" film edge markings]</div>
    <div class="author-name">井上雄彦</div>
    <div class="body-text">
      <p>多亏大家的支持，《灌篮高手》才能出版第10卷，衷心感谢各位读者朋友。</p>
      <p>自开始连载已经过去了两年，然而故事中才刚过两个月。如果连载了两年才过两个月的话，那樑木他们升高二的时候岂不是还要等12年，到他们毕业的话，还要等36年……</p>
      <p>我想不会的。</p>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
